With water you want to identify it not clear it.  You could quaff the
uncursed one to identify the rest or use a scroll on it.  Once
identified the blessed one will show as holy water and the cursed
ones as unholy water.  Since it is ia lot easier to create holy
water from uncursed water than it is to create unholy water from
uncursed water, you probably don't really want to uncursed those
3.  At least not all of them.  Unholy water has enough uses that
you will want some eventually.

